SAFETY NOTICE

This software coordinates heating equipment. It is provided as-is and comes
with no guarantee of suitability for any particular hydronic installation.
Minimum circulation flow, bypass or hydraulic decoupling, expansion vessel
sizing, floor-heating supply-temperature limits and boiler post-purge are
hardware safety functions and remain the responsibility of the installer.

Do not enable coordinated control before completing the device-semantics and
hydraulics verification described in the documentation.
